{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50606","headline":"又一首 · 独孤及","name":"又一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上天垂光兮熙予以青春，今日何日兮共此良辰。\n与君觥浊酒而藉落英兮，（「觥浊酒」，《唐文粹》卷九六引此序作「觵浊醪」。\n）如年华之相亲。\n（「如年华之相亲」，《唐文粹》作「不知年华之相亲」。\n）蹇淹留以醉止。\n孰云含意而未申。\n（案此诗载《全唐文》卷三百八十七独孤及《仲春裴胄先宅宴集联句赋诗序》一文中。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50606.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50606","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}